</aside><div class="r3-aw-main"><div class="r3-pf-top"><span class="r3-pf-agent"><span class="r3-pf-aico"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"></rect><path d="M16 3v4M8 3v4M3 10h18"></path></svg></span><b>Lead Qualifier</b></span></div><div class="ws-split" data-config="true"><HeroConfig client:visible agent={heroAgent} /><div class="ws-chat"><div class="r3-ap-thread r3-hx-thread"><div class="r3-hx-scroll" style="animation:r3_ia8 24.0s cubic-bezier(.3,.7,.2,1) infinite"><div class="r3-ap-user r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia21 24.0s linear infinite"><p>Qualify the 3 new leads from the website form and add them to HubSpot.</p></div><div class="r3-ap-worked r3-hx-wk r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia22 24.0s linear infinite"><span class="r3-hx-working r3-an r3-an-end0" style="animation:r3_ia23 24.0s linear infinite"><em class="r3-hx-shim">Working…</em></span><span class="r3-hx-worked r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia24 24.0s linear infinite">Worked for 38s <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></div><div class="r3-ap-tl r3-hx-tl"><div class="r3-ap-step r3-th r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia9 24.0s linear infinite"><span class="r3-ap-node"><span class="r3-hx-spin r3-an r3-an-end0" style="animation:r3_ia10 24.0s linear infinite"><i></i></span><span class="r3-hx-ic r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia11 24.0s linear infinite"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4M6 6l2.5 2.5M15.5 15.5 18 18M6 18l2.5-2.5M15.5 8.5 18 6"></path></svg></span></span><span class="r3-ap-st">Reading the 3 new form submissions…</span><span class="r3-ap-c"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></div><div class="r3-ap-step r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia12 24.0s linear infinite"><span class="r3-ap-node"><span class="r3-hx-spin r3-an r3-an-end0" style="animation:r3_ia13 24.0s linear infinite"><i></i></span><span class="r3-hx-ic r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia14 24.0s linear infinite"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"></path></svg></span></span><span class="r3-ap-st">Researched <b>the 3 companies on the web</b></span><span class="r3-ap-c"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></span></div><div class="r3-ap-step r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia15 24.0s linear infinite"><span class="r3-ap-node"><span class="r3-hx-spin r3-an r3-an-end0" style="animation:r3_ia16 24.0s linear infinite"><i></i></span><span class="r3-hx-ic r3-an" style="animation:r3_ia17 24.0s linear infinite"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.9M16 3.1a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.8"></path></svg></span></span><span class="r3-ap-st">Checked <b>them against your criteria</b></span><span class="r3-ap-c"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hid